e gap between theory and practice, leading to technologies that have transformed industries and improved lives. As AI continues to evolve, MIT\u2019s role as a leader in the field will undoubtedly remain central, shaping the future of intelligent machines and their relationship with humanity. Whether through foundational research, entrepreneurial ventures, or policy initiatives, MIT\u2019s influence on AI is a testament to the power of academic excellence, collaboration, and visionary thinking."
